#: ../../source/3-concepts/6-submodules_visibility.md:33
#: 622baaf6e1b54f82a0bbc11a5f27a8a3
msgid ""
"**Nested visibility:** `public` (external) or `private` (needs internal "
"GitHub access). This only affects nested modules **inside** each repo."
msgstr "**嵌套可见性：** `public`（外部）或 `private`（需要内部 GitHub 权限）。这只影响各仓库**内部**的嵌套模块。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/6-submodules_visibility.md:34
#: fcc0e773ca0440aba5b131ff1eeaa4fb
msgid ""
"**Core module mode:** per module `d` (GitHub Release `.deb`) or `s` "
"(source). Top-level `ocs2_ros2`, `arms_ros2_control`, and `robot-"
"descriptions/common` are initialized when you pick **source**."
msgstr ""
"**核心模块模式：** 按模块选 `d`（GitHub Release `.deb`）或 `s`（源码）。选择**源码**时才会初始化顶层 "
"`ocs2_ros2`、`arms_ros2_control` 和 `robot-descriptions/common`。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/6-submodules_visibility.md:36
#: 7c3d0dcc881f407eb21af2bec51e2337
msgid ""
"Then the script inits nested modules according to visibility (skipped if "
"the parent or common is deb), checks out configured branches, runs "
"`rosdep` on source paths, and installs chosen debs."
msgstr ""
"随后脚本按可见性初始化嵌套模块（父模块或 common 为 deb 时跳过），检出配置的分支，在源码路径上运行 `rosdep`，并安装所选 "
"deb。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/6-submodules_visibility.md:38
#: 723d45a2957849c4a709ecf5ed5a4912
msgid "Do **not** `git submodule update --init --recursive` as the primary path."
msgstr "**不要盲目递归初始化** — `git submodule update --init --recursive` 会在私有模块上失败"

